const RING = "<rect x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"64\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#1B2444\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"64\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#2A3556\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"17\" width=\"60\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#B99340\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"22\" width=\"60\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#B99340\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"27\" width=\"60\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#B99340\"/><rect x=\"1\" y=\"17\" width=\"2\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#5E6B95\"/><rect x=\"61\" y=\"17\" width=\"2\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#5E6B95\"/>";

const FPS = 9;
let seq = 0;

export const SECONDS = Object.fromEntries(
  Object.entries(SEQ).map(([k, v]) => [k, v.length / FPS]));

export function animation(name = "toss", size = 150) {
  const frames = SEQ[name] || SEQ.toss;
  const id = "a" + (++seq);
  const dur = frames.length / FPS;
  const css = frames.map((_, i) => {
    const a = (i / frames.length * 100).toFixed(4);
    const b = ((i + 1) / frames.length * 100).toFixed(4);
    return `@keyframes ${id}k${i}{0%,${a}%{opacity:0}`
      + `${a}%,${(+b - 0.0001).toFixed(4)}%{opacity:1}`
      + `${b}%,100%{opacity:0}}`
      + `#${id}f${i}{animation:${id}k${i} ${dur}s steps(1,end) 1 forwards}`;
  }).join("");
  return `<svg viewBox="0 0 64 40" width="${size}" role="img"
    aria-label="8-bit wrestling animation">
    <style>${css}
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
        [id^="${id}f"]{animation:none;opacity:0}
        #${id}f${frames.length - 1}{opacity:1}}
    </style>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="#0A0E1C" rx="2"/>
    ${RING}
    ${frames.map((f, i) => `<g id="${id}f${i}">${f}</g>`).join("")}
  </svg>`;
}

// Kept for callers written before the other two existed.
export const tossAnimation = (size) => animation("toss", size);
export const TOSS_SECONDS = SEQ.toss.length / FPS;
